                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Q}[0]
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/object"} object
              in this category is a pair consisting of a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dgc-algebra"} dgc-algebra
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
              and a dg-algebra
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homomorphism"} homomorphism
              of the form
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ϵ
                      %mi A
