                  {\bot}
                  dgcoAlg_k
          %p (…)
          %h2#statement Statement
          %p We want to claim the following:
          %p
            For every
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi 𝔤
                  %mo ∈
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
