          %p
            Idea of proof: the analogous statement for simplicial Lie algebras replaced by rational
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/simplicial+algebras"} simplicial algebras
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
